          "explanationHtml": "<p>Structure: <strong>because of + noun/gerund</strong><br />\nthe bad weather is a noun =&gt; because of is the correct answer</p>\n",
          "explanationViHtml": "<p>Cấu tr&uacute;c:&nbsp;<strong>because of + noun/gerund</strong></p>\n\n<p>&quot;the bad weather&quot; l&agrave; danh từ =&gt; &quot;because of&quot; l&agrave; đ&aacute;p &aacute;n đ&uacute;ng</p>\n",
          "transcriptHtml": "<p>Structure: <strong>because of + noun/gerund</strong><br />\nthe bad weather is a noun =&gt; because of is the correct answer</p>\n"
        }
